m("Match: (a) Inner Circle (b) Outer Circle (c) Expanding Circle with (i) norm-dependent (ii) norm-providing (iii) norm-developing",["a-ii, b-iii, c-i","a-i, b-ii, c-iii","a-iii, b-i, c-ii","a-ii, b-i, c-iii"],0,"Inner provides, Outer develops, Expanding depends on norms."),
m("'The Indianization of English' (1983) was written by:",["Raja Rao","Braj B. Kachru","R.K. Narayan","Edgar Schneider"],1,"Braj Kachru's landmark study of Indian English."),
