m("'The Fakeer of Jungheera' (1828) is a work of:",["Kashiprasad Ghosh","H.L.V. Derozio","Toru Dutt","Manmohan Ghose"],1,"Derozio, teacher at Hindu College and inspirer of Young Bengal."),
