m("'Jejuri', which won the Commonwealth Poetry Prize, was written by:",["Arun Kolatkar","Dilip Chitre","Adil Jussawalla","Gieve Patel"],0,"Arun Kolatkar, 'Jejuri' (1976)."),
m("Which collection is considered the beginning of modern Indian English poetry?",["The Exact Name","A Time to Change","The Striders","Summer in Calcutta"],1,"Nissim Ezekiel's 'A Time to Change' (1952)."),
m("Arrange R.K. Narayan's novels chronologically: I. The Guide II. Swami and Friends III. The English Teacher IV. The Vendor of Sweets",["II, III, I, IV","II, I, III, IV","III, II, I, IV","II, III, IV, I"],0,"1935, 1945, 1958, 1967."),
